type Hero, Room, Door, Key, Trap

Ash is a Hero
Entrance is a Room
Hall is a Room
Library is a Room
Armory is a Room
Crypt is a Room
Vault is a Room
Shrine is a Room
Front-Door is a Door
Library-Arch is a Door
Armory-Gate is a Door
Crypt-Stair is a Door
Vault-Gate is a Door
Crypt-Door is a Door
Shrine-Door is a Door
Bronze-Key is a Key
Iron-Key is a Key
Silver-Key is a Key
Spike-Trap is a Trap

Front-Door
  leads from Entrance to Hall
  is unlocked
Library-Arch
  leads from Hall to Library
  is unlocked
Armory-Gate
  leads from Hall to Armory
  is locked by Bronze-Key
Crypt-Stair
  leads from Library to Crypt
  is unlocked
Vault-Gate
  leads from Armory to Vault
  is locked by Bronze-Key
Crypt-Door
  leads from Crypt to Vault
  is locked by Iron-Key
Shrine-Door
  leads from Crypt to Shrine
  is locked by Silver-Key
Spike-Trap
  is armed in Hall
  is telegraphed

initially
  Ash is in Entrance
  Bronze-Key lies in Library
  Iron-Key lies in Crypt

given Door leads from {here: Room} to {there: Room}
given Door is unlocked
given Door is locked by Key
  at most one key per door
given Trap is armed in Room
given Trap is telegraphed

state Hero is in Room
  exactly one room per hero
state Key lies in Room
  at most one room per key
state Hero holds Key
state Trap warned Hero
state Trap hurt Hero

derived Door opens for Hero

event move: Hero moves through Door
event pick-up: Hero picks up Key
event strike: Trap strikes Hero

rule unlocked-doors-open: ?door opens for ?hero
  when ?door is unlocked
  and ?hero is a Hero

rule held-keys-open: ?door opens for ?hero
  when ?door is locked by ?key
  and ?hero holds ?key

on ?hero moves through ?door
  when ?hero is in ?here
  and ?door leads from ?here to ?there
  and ?door opens for ?hero
  then ?hero is in ?there

on ?hero moves through ?door
  when ?hero is in ?here
  and ?door leads from ?here to ?there
  and ?door opens for ?hero
  and ?trap is armed in ?there
  and ?trap is telegraphed
  then ?trap warned ?hero

on ?hero picks up ?key
  when ?hero is in ?room
  and ?key lies in ?room
  then not ?key lies in ?room
  and ?hero holds ?key

on ?_ strikes ?hero
  when ?trap is armed in ?room
  and ?hero is in ?room
  then ?trap hurt ?hero

requirements for the level
  possibly Ash is in Vault
  ?hero is in Vault only after ?hero is in Library
  possibly Ash is in Vault has no single point of failure among ?key lies in ?room
  ?trap strikes ?hero only when ?trap warned ?hero
  never Ash is in Shrine
